

## I. Verify basic REST access on DB-OBJECT:
#
# 1. verify GET request that returns single docuemnt,
# 2. verify GET request that returns multiple docuemnts,
# 3. verify POST request inserts a new document,
# 4. verify PUT request updates a document,
# 5. verify DELETE removes a document,
# 6. verify component procedure execution,
# 7. verify component procedure result conversion,
# 8. verify router-driven MySQL task is rejected in embedded MRS mode,
# 9. verify repeated procedure REST requests on the single component I/O thread,
# 10. verify recovery after a component procedure execution error.
# 11. verify a procedure result larger than 1 MiB.

